# cowork-harness staleness hash_ignore (composes with session staleness.hash_ignore).
# Paths here do NOT affect recorded skill behavior, so editing them must not re-stale cassettes.
#
# NOTE: a slash-free name matches that dir at ANY depth (this compiles to ^(?:.*/)?tests(?:/.*)?$).
# Today the only `tests` dir under this mount is the top-level founder-skills/tests/ (pytest only).
# If a skill ever ships RUNTIME fixtures under skills/<x>/tests/, this would silently exclude them —
# revisit then. Do NOT add `**/*.md`: SKILL.md is runtime and must stay in the hash.
tests/
